 	      - the KVM_REG_ARM64_SVE_VLS pseudo-register is immutable, and can
 	        no longer be written using KVM_SET_ONE_REG.
 
+	- KVM_ARM_VCPU_REC: Allocate a REC (Realm Execution Context) for this
